  - m_Id: 4473271251623936
    m_Key: TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4474597175975936
    m_Key: Use the A and D keys to move the ship left and right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4474600040685568
    m_Key: Sail past a dock to automatically collect and deliver cargo for points.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4474602259472384
    m_Key: Crashing into rocks and islands will break your cargo, and you'll lose
      a heart!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4474604260155392
    m_Key: Rain soaks books, snow harms animals, and sunbeams rot bananas.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4474605963042816
    m_Key: Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
